<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρώβολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of four obols</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).860.29
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Tenos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρώβολον</span></b> , τό, <i>four-obol piece</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρωβόλου τοῦτ᾽ ἔστιν</span> (as Kuster for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρώβολον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				254
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.8.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				982.15
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), etc.; it was a soldier's
			daily pay, hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρωβόλου βίος</span> a
				<i>soldier's</i> life, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				307
			</span></i>; so in masc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώβολος</span>, of a
			common soldier, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				203
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρώβολον, τό</span>, <i>weight of four obols</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.628
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
